=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {p:Cleades (A)} at (G-5). Take Veridical Conflux #06 and head southeast to reach him.
* Next to {p:Cleades (A)} are some **Lined Boxes** which you can obtain your {p:Soulgauger SGR-1} and purchase {i:Gauger Plates|Gauger Plate|2480} for 5 {p:Cruor} each. You can buy up to 12 {i:Gauger Plates|Gauger Plate|2480} at once.
* Much like using a {p:Soultrapper}, you will equip the {p:Soulgauger SGR-1} and {i:Gauger Plates|Gauger Plate|2480} and then look for an NM to get a good quality capture of. Unlike when farming {p:Zeni}, you do not need to lower the mob's HP.
** You need to have a good distance (~5 yalms) and frontal angle on the mob. Distance and angle appear to the major factors in appraisal of your captures.
** Only NMs in {z:Abyssea - Konschtat} can be captured with the {p:Soulgauger SGR-1}. It cannot be used in other {p:Abyssea} areas.
** Good NM suggestions are {m:Guimauve} and {m:Pavan}, since they are close by and do not aggro.
* Return to {p:Cleades (A)} and trade your captures to him. He will then appraise your work.
** There are four appraisal levels that result in different {p:cruor|Cruor} rewards and text from the NPC.
** If your trade is rejected, you can trade him another until he finally accepts one to complete the quest.

__This quest can only be completed **once per Vana'diel day.**__
